@title 3D toolbar stays clear of the view cube with the Navigator open
@area Layout
# At 1366x768 the toolbar, pushed right by the open Navigator, ran under the
# view cube. Its width now leaves out the Navigator's share of the view.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D
wait 20
click_text Pages
wait 8
shot toolbar-and-cube
check_layout
